Good morning from Madison Daily. Here is what is happening around town today. Three local stories to start your morning: First, the downtown farmers market announces its opening weekend schedule for local vendors. Second, city council approves funding for new bike lane expansions near the near East Side. Third, the UW arboretum hosts a weekend guided nature walk focusing on native spring wildflowers. Have a wonderful day in Madison.
